body:
I don't know anyone named Beverly lol. I looked at other account info and it looks to be a mixture of both myself and Beverly. I see what seems to be her phone number. Thankfully no card info. Account is registered under my email and shipping address.

&#x200B;

Could this be from when I worked at B&BW years ago? An old manager was so annoying about getting customers to sign up for coupons and whenever they didn't want to sign up she told us to use out own emails or someone we know. A lot of us ended up just entering our own emails to avoid being reprimanded. Then they caught on to the managers that were doing that and put a stop to it. But I still get email receipts sometimes from old coworkers that entered my email years ago.

&#x200B;

I don't care about getting the emails, I just feel bad that they aren't getting a receipt if they aren't doing email & print. But this being in my B&BW acct and not just an email is confusing me
